# The build context is the repo root, so this allowlists rather than excludes:
# nothing reaches the image unless it is named here, which keeps .env files,
# maester-data, node_modules and the other products out of it.
*
!apps/maester/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/maester/api/uv.lock
!apps/maester/api/maester
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
